WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:33.430
My father wrote me an invitation.

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.000
Do you want to go to Izmal's party?

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.800
But... is it alright?

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:45.110
The other side already knows that Rumaty and I are connected.

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:49.380
If it's discovered that you and I are connected...

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:52.340
It's too convenient.

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.390
If that does happen...

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:57.310
they'll contact me on their own.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.950
Mustafa...

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:08.060
"Warmth"

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:14.890
Let's do it.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:17.170
Just in case something happens to Eugene...

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:19.280
let's go let the American ambassador know what's going on.

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.570
By this time the Embassy will be closed.

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:25.840
We'll go straight to the ambassador's house.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.320
H--his house? Even without an appointment?

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:33.050
I can't just sit here...

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:34.640
I have to do whatever I can to help.

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.720
Let's at least wait for morning!

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:41.020
I'm sure they won't rush to cause an international incident.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:44.080
A French aristocrat with VIP friends...

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:45.700
they can't lay a hand on him.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.350
You can wait here, Toranosuke.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.840
I'll go by myself.

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:51.830
Hey! Please wait for me!

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.150
I'm coming, too. Miss Kajika!

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:03.100
2nd Lt. Noei...

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.090
Is His Highness Rumaty here?

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.070
His Highness is still in his bedroom, resting.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.640
Sezun, do you have a moment?

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:14.490
Sure.

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.130
I'm just making some tea.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:20.850
Sezun.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:25.880
Tonight I'm going back to our country.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:29.110
Lieutenant! W--what?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.900
But Raginei has closed its borders!

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.440
There's a smuggling route from Malaysia.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.700
I got a fake passport.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.100
This is crazy.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:46.150
Besides, even if you get into the country, think about your position as 2nd Lt...

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:51.580
Prince Somand.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:54.350
I have to see the Prince...

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.500
whatever it takes.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.090
It seems to me...

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:03.170
someone is pulling his strings.

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:08.890
Prince Somand's nature is to be timid and gentle.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:14.420
It's not in him to scheme or to deceive.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.190
I should never have left His Highness' side.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:26.260
I thought the way to show my loyalty was to obey his word...

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:28.980
I've been so stupid.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:33.720
It was like leaving a small child at the mercy of hungry beasts.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:36.660
Lieutenant...

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:39.230
Perhaps it's too late, but...

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.740
I want one more chance to advise him, from the bottom of my heart...

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:46.180
Even if it risks my life!

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:49.890
You plan to die, then!?

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.730
That's real stupidity!

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:55.610
You think Prince Somand as he is now will just meekly hear you out?

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:58.050
Sezun.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.360
I don't intend to die in vain...

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:04.700
but I don't intend to live while standing idly, either.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:07.020
I've thought this through.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:12.340
This is the only way I have to atone.

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:15.980
Give me your support...

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:17.890
Sezun...

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.510
You are a kindred soul.

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.560
I want to have you send me out there wholeheartedly.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.280
If I told you I wanted you to take me with you...

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:31.760
It would be useless, wouldn't it?

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:35.740
You have a duty to protect Prince Rumaty...

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:38.270
Yes, I do.

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:40.250
I do, but...

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:45.410
Sezun...

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:48.790
to be able to find a friend like you that I can rely on...

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.630
has made me happy to the bottom of my heart.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.550
I leave Prince Rumaty in your hands...

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:02.970
Lieutenant Noei!

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:05.750
I...

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.500
you...

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.310
you have my respect and love!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:12.250
More than my brother! More than anyone!

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:15.270
We'll meet again in Raginei!

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.810
In the Royal Palace... all together!

00:06:25.980 --> 00:06:29.000
I would gladly die in his place...

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.620
Lord... please protect the Lieutenant!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.390
A smuggling route... in Malaysia...?

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:21.250
Ah--oops...

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.010
What is it?

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.560
I forgot Dad's business card... I'll go get it!

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:27.090
Business card?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.860
For something like this we need to use every connection!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.670
H--hey, please don't leave me behind!

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:37.300
Welcome back, Master Rosenthal.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.640
Young master, what would you like to eat?

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.310
I'm tired. I'm going to sleep for a bit.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.750
Wake me up in three hours.

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:55.230
Harris... you can hold on to the food for now.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.740
Yes, sir, I'll do that.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:00.760
I'll go get it right now...

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.650
so wait here, Toranosuke.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.170
S--sure, got it!

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:07.740
--Ah, wait!
--Hm?

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.100
What floor?

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:16.810
Sorry, it's the 29th.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.380
The 29th floor?

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.730
This girl is a VIP?

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:27.990
Excuse me, but you aren't from Raginei, are you?

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:30.830
Nope, I just arrived today.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.670
You got in alright?

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:38.300
It's just that it's very difficult to enter this country right now...

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:44.790
Hm... my dad has done business here for a long time, maybe that's why.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:47.250
Business?

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.700
Huh? Did it break down?

00:08:57.810 --> 00:08:58.990
Are you okay?

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:01.230
This is a hotel, they'll send help soon...

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.750
C--can't... breathe...

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:14.010
Help... please...

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:15.810
I'm scared...

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:18.250
It hurts!

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:21.230
It hurts...

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:22.810
No more...

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:24.770
this is it...

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.030
I'm going to die...

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.970
What's this?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:36.950
This light...

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:41.070
Who is that?

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:42.960
This hand is...

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.830
warm.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.890
You're awake... are you okay?

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.690
Where am I?

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:00.120
In my room.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:03.000
You collapsed in the elevator.

00:10:03.980 --> 00:10:05.400
Sorry to trouble you...

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:06.670
Don't overdo it!

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:12.570
Look, Toranosuke went to call a doctor, so lie down and rest...

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:19.050
Are you cold? Do you have a fever?

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:20.910
I'm fine.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:23.380
This isn't an illness.

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:28.100
It's embarrassing, but...

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:30.270
I'm claustrophobic.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.050
So... in other words...

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.890
you don't like confined spaces?

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:40.650
Once, when I was six years old...

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.090
I fell into a well.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:47.690
My body won't let me forget the terror I felt.

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:50.570
It's pathetic, but...

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.540
It's no good, even now.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:56.590
In a confined space, especially if it's dark or anything...

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.300
I have trouble breathing, I break out in a cold sweat...

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:04.110
and this trembling, it won't stop for a long time.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.180
There's nothing anyone can do... really.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.590
It's not pathetic at all.

00:11:12.170 --> 00:11:14.070
It's just because that scary thing happened to you.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.060
It can't be helped.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.020
I thought it had gotten better, but...

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:26.970
If I can't brace myself for it, it still causes this kind of fit.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:34.320
Even if you can't stop trembling... that's okay.

00:11:35.050 --> 00:11:36.730
Let your body do what it wants.

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:40.450
There's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.150
Relax...

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:47.160
It's okay... we'll turn all the lights on...

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.640
so you can put your mind at ease...

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:54.040
at ease...

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:59.090
Look. It stopped already.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.110
It's true.

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:05.140
How strange...

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.170
so quickly...

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:11.140
Are you thirsty?

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:12.550
I'll bring you some water.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:15.390
Ah--yes, thank you.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.050
When I have a fit...

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:22.350
I always feel awful when I wake up...

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:27.380
but just now I woke up as if I'd just gotten a good night's sleep.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:31.190
As if someone reached down...

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:34.400
and pulled me out of the abyss.

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:42.680
Um... did you... possibly...

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:45.770
hold my hand while I was sleeping?

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.640
Mm-hmm... you were in a cold sweat, and it looked like you were suffering.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.490
You reached out your hand, so I took it by reflex.

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:56.250
You held on pretty tight... did it hurt you?

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:59.130
No, no... I'm grateful.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:06.470
Come to think of it, something warm would be better... I'll make some tea.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.730
She has a pleasant voice...

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:19.010
Why is it I feel so calm just sitting here listening to her?

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.220
A girl so much younger than me...

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:25.490
who I'm meeting for the first time?

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:29.260
Would you tell me your name?

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.760
I'm Carl Rosenthal.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.820
Carl... what a nice name.

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.860
I'm Kajika, Kajika Burnsworth.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.360
...Burnsworth?

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:47.000
Do you take milk?

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:53.570
You're not resting...

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:56.070
No. I'm fine now.

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:58.020
Thanks for the help.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.700
But...

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:02.370
Someday you will see my gratitude.

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.370
Yo, Gregory!

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:24.960
Here again, Eddie Roberts?

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:28.690
Reporters sure have a lot of free time.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.240
Whatever.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:33.980
If Prince Izmal says I can be here, I can be here.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:37.530
At any rate, there's lots of turbulence in Raginei now...

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:40.450
As a journalist, I can't tear my eyes away.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:46.710
It's more like you can't tear your stomach away, since all you do is eat and drink all day while you claim to be gathering facts.

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:49.940
Just trying to walk a mile in the shoes of another country's people...

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:53.250
Better yet, care to tell me whose stooge you are?

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:56.770
Prince Izmal has pretty bad taste...

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.610
He ought to think about a decent reporter...

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.720
What was that?

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:12.670
Eugene De Volkan...

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.950
Hey--hey, you!

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:22.450
You're Eugene De Volkan.

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:24.990
Yes, and?

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:29.140
What a surprise! To meet with you in a place like this.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:30.900
I'm Eddie Roberts.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.570
Freelance reporter for the "Lumière de Paris."

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:38.580
Ah... the third-rate gossip rag?

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:43.400
Hehe, you're pretty tough. You've given me a real hard time.

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:45.310
A hard time?

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:52.120
Indeed... you're not like the typical handsome man...

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:55.480
I've followed you...

00:15:56.290 --> 00:16:01.710
when the girls you go out with die, it's harder to clean up than a normal playboy's affairs, huh?

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.750
At that point there was pressure from above to put a stop to it...

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.790
I never got to meet the man himself...

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.070
I'm tired of this conversation.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.970
Hey, wait up!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:17.430
Did you come to spy on Prince Izmal?

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:22.480
I don't know what Burnsworth's giving you in return, but it's not enough.

00:16:25.440 --> 00:16:28.510
Your ties to the Burnsworth family are common knowledge.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:33.100
You understand? This is front line headquarters for the Rosenthals.

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.440
Rosenthal?

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:38.010
Burnsworth's old enemy?

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:45.510
For half a year now I've been chasing the story on the Raginei royal family discord.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:49.240
Thanks to you, the "Lumière de Paris" let me go.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:54.060
So my journalistic life depends on this material.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:58.780
If you're interested... I can offer you a piece...

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.760
What information do you have?

00:17:02.610 --> 00:17:05.200
I'll tell you who really rules this house.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:10.320
In exchange, an interview with Prince Rumaty.

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:14.770
Eddie... I'm not prejudiced, but...

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:21.810
I do discriminate: I ignore overly familiar men in bad tuxedos.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.230
Rude.

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:32.680
Wha--Well, it's just a rental! I don't understand!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:41.030
Oh, my, that's exactly right, Master Izmal.

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.200
Oh, stop, I'm shy...

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:46.600
It's the absolute truth.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:52.890
What's all the hubbub?

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:54.800
A new guest, probably.

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:57.450
Ah, the usual French--

00:17:58.050 --> 00:17:59.130
Your Highness.

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:03.140
My name is Eugene De Volkan.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:08.380
It was a pleasure to receive your invitation for tonight, thank you very much.

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:14.510
Move.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.820
Move! Vacate your seat!

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:19.300
O--of course!

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:23.340
Glad you could come from so far away! Sit here! I give my permission!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.970
I'm honored.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:29.610
What excellent "platinum blonde" hair...

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:31.680
Would you be interested in touching it?

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:35.080
Your Highness would be welcome to.

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:38.410
Go ahead, please be my guest.

00:18:50.470 --> 00:18:52.370
He's already falling under his spell.

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:54.890
He doesn't stand a chance.

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:59.060
He's like Izmal's ideal type made flesh.

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:01.190
And word from Carl?

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:03.030
We still haven't heard from him.

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:07.320
There's nothing else for it. Go ask the other one for instructions.

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:21.090
Hello, I'm back! I had some trouble finding a doctor...

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:23.640
Huh?

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.560
Where's the patient?

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:29.680
He said a little sleep made him feel better and left a while ago.

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.290
Huh? Well, was he okay?

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.370
Mm-hmm.

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:41.050
I'm fine now. Someday you will see my gratitude.

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:46.910
I'm sorry.  You went to the trouble of coming here...

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.810
Don't worry about it, I'm happy to hear he felt better.

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:56.610
Well, it got a little late...

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:58.530
let's go to the ambassador's house.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:01.430
What? Now?

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:04.020
I got Dad's business card!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:05.970
If you don't want to come, you don't have to!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:09.340
I'm coming, I'm coming!

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:15.300
Tonight is the most fun I've had in a long time.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:19.530
You can stay here tonight, Eugene.

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:21.700
Thank you.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:24.580
But I'm afraid I have to go for tonight.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.950
I want to tell my father right away...

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.540
about the honor of getting to know Your Highness.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:36.800
Although our Volkan Group wants to advance our dealings with Raginei...

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.040
there are some serious difficulties.

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:44.360
Just as we were advancing preparations, there was this business about a coup d'etat.

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:50.320
My father also worries about just how far he should go with Burnsworth.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:53.220
Do you have ill-will towards Burnsworth, too?

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:56.040
Yes. A great deal.

00:20:56.370 --> 00:21:00.080
That's a point I would like to discuss with you further...

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:01.730
How about tomorrow?

00:21:02.540 --> 00:21:03.870
I'll visit tomorrow.

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:06.870
Make sure you come!

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:09.560
Yes, I certainly will.

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:17.640
If I weren't doing it for Kajika, I'd rather die than have to play that role.

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.630
Going home already, Volkan?

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:25.950
You haven't met the most important person yet.

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:29.790
What do you think? Shall I show you the way?

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:31.860
The most important person?

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:34.950
Prince Izmal does whatever this person tells him.

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:38.660
As a matter of fact, they're the head of this estate.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.370
The person Eddie told me about?

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:47.370
I could say I don't want to meet them, but...it wouldn't matter, would it.

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:51.830
You understand, then.

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:54.310
And you won't make us go to any trouble...

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:58.060
More than anything, the person in there hates waiting.

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:04.560
Here we are. Go on in.

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:09.330
No need to worry, you'll soon be able to go home...

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:12.890
as long as you stay on the good side of her temper...

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:15.100
Huh? "Her?"

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:22.430
You, come.

00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:26.250
A high voice... a young girl's voice...

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:37.240
You would come to a place like this for the Burnsworth girl...

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:44.780
You're quite foolish, aren't you. Eugene.

00:22:45.650 --> 00:22:46.870
And you are?

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:51.760
I'm the fourth in line for the throne of Raginei...

00:22:54.240 --> 00:22:55.750
Najayra.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
